# legs/adult/pose/tips: shoe tips under a long hem in the postures (POSES-B, P2b wave 2; like legs/adult/loco/tips):
# drawn over the hem's under-edge (the dress, robe, gown, kaftan and wrap hangs' floor, kneel and ride keys cover the legs).
# Regions: B shoe, O sole (rags: bare feet).
#   cross  the two shoe tips peeking out toe to toe under the lap's hem
#   kneel  the planted shoe before the hem and the kneeling foot's sole behind it
#   ride   the boots below the ridden-up hem, in the stirrups either side of the barrel
use person woman
body adult
role legs tips
layer hangFront
anchor pivot
keys legs
z 9

view D key cross origin 6 1
mark hip 6 -1
|..fiihgf..
|..KKKKKK..
regions
|..BBBBBB..
|..OOOOOO..

